MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

When comparing “how far away” parameter estimates are from the true values,
 you must always take uncertainty (due to the finite random sample) into account.
 You need to at least look at the posterior quantiles, not just the posterior mean.

Finn

